== Overview ==
The Teacher Toilet is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that only appears in the [[Evil Wave]]. Upon killing both him and the [[Student Toilet]], you will receive 1000 [[coins]] and the badge associated with the Evil wave.

== Appearance ==
The teacher toilet has a dark green toilet and a green neck. The toilet also has a brown beard along with glasses. It also has the squinting eyes Roblox head.

== Waves ==
The Teacher Toilet is not restricted to any wave and can spawn at any time. Every time a wave ends, there is a 0.1% chance that the wave will turn to an [[Evil Wave]] and this enemy and the Student Toilet will spawn. Of course, you can’t skip to the next wave.
